lass=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I choose to believe Sullivan Dane took out 6 of the 7 himself.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I have 0 of Mage lore, I really can't keep up with you guys (beyond Sullivan Dane metion). <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T06:35:09-07:00","id":1330379,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1330022-v5-thoughts-on-vienna?p=1330310#post1330310\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Swathes of Tremere rituals, Paths and research no longer exist and in fact retroactively never existed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Kiiiiinda? They don't exist as player options, but NPCs are still described with various magic powers. One of the loresheets from Chicago by Night has a Tremere oracle who uses blood magic for divination. Erichtho has spirit allies and references having rituals for summoning and binding elemental spirits. Eirchtho's sire, Nicolai, is described as having &quot;showed Tracy miracles: blood dancing in the air and words sculpted from lightning.&quot;<br /> So the powers are still there, you just can't have them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T09:09:24-07:00","id":1330391,"title":"","content":"I'm not saying that vampires should be untouchable by normal humans.<br /> I'm saying that vampires of the 6th generation and below should be untouchable by normal humans.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T10:21:24-07:00","id":1330401,"title":"","content":"That would be dull.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T10:27:55-07:00","id":1330405,"title":"","content":"I would just like to say as someone who has seen military drones in real life. They are much bigger then you think. They are around the size of a small to large plane depending on the payload. Doesn't really matter as they are so high in altitude that you'll never see them. Stuff like the RQ-11 Raven is for recon only and generally used by cav scouts who are already forward in a Bardly or HMMWV. Very short ranged stuff compared to ones like the Predator C, Avenger. <br /> <br /> The Predator would probably be the best bet of getting the job done as it's first official flight was 2009. It is designed for stealth so it really shouldn't be able to get picked up by any civilian radar at the time. But if I was given the task of blowing up a hide out of vampires I would go with Heavy Arms with truck bombs. Simple, low cost and easy to blame on just about anyone you want. <br /> <br /> Having said all that there is no way that some elder or group wasn't backing the SI to have Vienna so easily destroyed. But the list of who wants to knock the Tremere down a peg is very very long. <br /> <br /> I would love to find out that Goratrix was behind it as it would put him at some fault for both Inquisitions. I just really love to hate that reckless bastard.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12509-mister-suicide","name":"Mister Suicide","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-11T10:46:00-07:00","id":1330408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mister Suicide</stron